{"id":669,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"文武両道の伝統を6年一貫で磨く","feature_description":"文武両道の伝統を受け継ぎ、6年間の中高一貫教育で真の学力の向上を図ります。豊富な授業時数に加え、キャリア教育プロジェクトや特色ある学習活動を通して、国際性と実践力を育てる市立の中高一貫校です。学校紹介ページでは部活動も一覧で示され、学びと活動を一体で捉えやすい構成です。進路意識を早くから高めやすいのも利点です。中高一貫の流れが見えやすく安心です。","clubs":[{"id":12588,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12589,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12590,"name":"サイエンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12591,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12592,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12593,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12594,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12595,"name":"華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12596,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12597,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12598,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12599,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":12600,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.keinet.com/gyokuc/introduction/","verified_at":"2026-08